  "entity": "APR 70 LLC\nRegistered in New York State",
  "submissionsEmail": "submissions@aprpictures.com",
  "founderBio": "I grew up on movies. Mom dragged me to all of them. She has an encyclopedic knowledge of movies and their stars. She passed that trait on to me, well, force fed it. The Honeymooners, the Twilight Zone to All in the Family and the Odd Couple. Star Trek too. I spent years behind the camera and in the control room -- shooting, cutting, and carrying shows that looked a lot better than their ratings. APR 70 is my stubborn answer to all the good stories that never got out of the kitchen or made it past development. I'm still in New York (can't seem to escape, its only been 56 years) with my two girls and spend my time between building a studio for people who still care about what goes on the screen and cooking pasta, telling kitchen stories to a new generation.",
